  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It’s likely that many who have never run a shop have, at some point, entertained the notion that owning one could be enjoyable—naturally, in a manner of their choosing, offering only items they appreciate and to customers they favor.",
      "output_sha256": "fb08f0493714ad27af6f04d251a1211b6e1bb59d7de38daaad1e999ddd4d28de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.308178,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "07ac0f3f9e509395991a6e9e963019b41b73030ea4a48c26451398c2828674fb",
        "08fea5a79c54a856274d67c63fb5c7e3a7ef4a60e782f0f8f2e46a719cb49345"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb08f0493714ad27af6f04d251a1211b6e1bb59d7de38daaad1e999ddd4d28de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The fact that there is no nursery game so popular as keeping shop probably proves this.",
      "output_sha256": "dd7e95a45d6d445f65f29be12f694d86d8906ec803df9ef435958ef44c2526a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd7e95a45d6d445f65f29be12f694d86d8906ec803df9ef435958ef44c2526a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And none is more popular, except, perhaps, among French country children, who prefer the game of market—each one presiding over a different stall, stocked with the most ingenious miniature counterfeits of vegetables and fruit fashioned chiefly from wild flowers and leaves, and all shouting against each other with terrific French volubility and not a little French wit.",
      "output_sha256": "bb1444c3b066010b8bbc3ce691f470aa8136ed4f1396d27e439c56e4e81929ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb1444c3b066010b8bbc3ce691f470aa8136ed4f1396d27e439c56e4e81929ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We seldom go so far as actually to open an establishment, but we play with the idea.",
      "output_sha256": "cdfa078b494ca1292b300f5ea39b35f0a6374181a4ae1b5006f54eb0ceeb10cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdfa078b494ca1292b300f5ea39b35f0a6374181a4ae1b5006f54eb0ceeb10cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One of my friends has for years projected a London centre for all the most interesting and vivid European pottery, and if only she could assemble it and maintain the supply, I have little doubt of her success.",
      "output_sha256": "bd7568758792d2493abd88cad5e9b9b71c55f760851d49ee0294961f68d5ccdb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd7568758792d2493abd88cad5e9b9b71c55f760851d49ee0294961f68d5ccdb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the chances are that it will never materialize, the people who do things being so rare.",
      "output_sha256": "8a2e852d87698c232c29eab88f4a1bdec5809e44c18fac63145c626e70861de9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a2e852d87698c232c29eab88f4a1bdec5809e44c18fac63145c626e70861de9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Another is at this moment excitedly planning a restaurant in a neighbourhood where one seems peculiarly to be needed, as it is chiefly populated by dwellers in flats, the slogan of which is to be \"Where to dine when cook goes out\"; but that, too, will probably end in talk.",
      "output_sha256": "69ac8d0ae55badf0a3901d3277871d532877489dd662d35e8621dd157fb19412",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "69ac8d0ae55badf0a3901d3277871d532877489dd662d35e8621dd157fb19412",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At first glance, it seems that a shop launched in an area lacking that type of establishment would stand a better chance than one opening next door to a similar shop—barring any potential rivalry.",
      "output_sha256": "b76fbc57d2efe17528b3ae1f620f7bc9bfd2646b39210aa9d4f7692d64c4ffef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.382662,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0e504b1b6c599a9b2ac5d614b43bf0a8ce5f18d957a325f9dc9db706d727474"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b76fbc57d2efe17528b3ae1f620f7bc9bfd2646b39210aa9d4f7692d64c4ffef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet the intricacies of business are perplexing, revealing numerous, often contradictory, paths to success.",
      "output_sha256": "f44320381921807712f072fe34b4298ef68a11b8726bcfc8bf82a5fe1fff0df3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.255956,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1745054a7e15d79879bce1e8f8ca8cf57d3daaff36d65b60504d835004ae2fef"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f44320381921807712f072fe34b4298ef68a11b8726bcfc8bf82a5fe1fff0df3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One would, at the first blush, have called this principle of scientific selection and segregation the soundest; and yet that of congregation seems to be just as sensible; so that while one man succeeds because he is the only tailor in the street, another man can be even more successful because he is in a street where every other establishment is a tailor's too.",
      "output_sha256": "91a8533f94856910687bede46ea863f34db35ea6b38421a4a335b1374cf45fc4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "91a8533f94856910687bede46ea863f34db35ea6b38421a4a335b1374cf45fc4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There are also the antagonistic principles of ostentation and self-effacement, each again apparently satisfactory: so that one hatter, for example, succeeds because he inhabits a palace of light, and another because you can hardly see through the grimy panes of his old-fashioned and obsolete windows.",
      "output_sha256": "12629a65caa119119df72807a70467b8dc0d00e7c53fa9f6f9963043d8b1fd99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "12629a65caa119119df72807a70467b8dc0d00e7c53fa9f6f9963043d8b1fd99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The dichotomy extends to the concepts of singularity and plurality as well, where one shopkeeper can achieve success with a single location, while another might build an empire with multiple outlets simultaneously.",
      "output_sha256": "9f585f847201bcf0b641b8522e4c990ddb04fa06250980d7ef68ffc6763b7d59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.310962,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7d6f33c604fe1e4baa1e98b963e9b15bdbbbc3e255587a56f2eb10ab709d23af"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9f585f847201bcf0b641b8522e4c990ddb04fa06250980d7ef68ffc6763b7d59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Then there are those business owners who succeed despite seemingly operating without any customers.",
      "output_sha256": "c6ad2dd8d232762cc5d057de0c27cfe8dcc12a6a55793fba71a4a0615d280579",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.398214,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d712f17eb7d1d7ef2960726eb0e44b9274f9216b1d08be04f955fcef71b9a6fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6ad2dd8d232762cc5d057de0c27cfe8dcc12a6a55793fba71a4a0615d280579",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We all know of shops which no one was ever seen to enter; while at the opposite pole are the mandarins of trade who disdain to disclose their identity to strangers—such as Altman and Tiffany, serenely secure in their anonymous stores.",
      "output_sha256": "347cd3ca92e01377f277783c5602273a1d5759d1f28b8d4fcef394ae730e53fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "347cd3ca92e01377f277783c5602273a1d5759d1f28b8d4fcef394ae730e53fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But to select one's line...?",
      "output_sha256": "bc04d2b87a087cbf09ecfc11909dbd7b4f51b9fac95e826412a9534653445e3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc04d2b87a087cbf09ecfc11909dbd7b4f51b9fac95e826412a9534653445e3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There was once a man who, without any special training, decided that he would start business in London; and he came to town to prospect and make up his mind, which was curiously blank and receptive.",
      "output_sha256": "5673ebb13842e1e93c5fccd07f721227e6ee3bf2b150ff4a50b2389d7c7eb6c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "5673ebb13842e1e93c5fccd07f721227e6ee3bf2b150ff4a50b2389d7c7eb6c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In his walking about he was struck by the number of old curiosity shops in the neighbourhood of the British Museum and South Kensington Museum, which led to the inference, hitherto unsuspected by him, but known to the dealers, that there is something exciting in the air of those places, so that the visitor, having seen many odd things, wishes to acquire some for himself.",
      "output_sha256": "85e05efcaa7341fe5fcc2c3fcdd878d8f70fa5e5c1fa91b519fa457d8a1086a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "85e05efcaa7341fe5fcc2c3fcdd878d8f70fa5e5c1fa91b519fa457d8a1086a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "All his plans to establish himself in London failed, however, because he could not obtain a site for a monumental mason's yard opposite Westminster Abbey.",
      "output_sha256": "f8c8e439a1dbe04b11d3975c8de93c3ad580d0d96d7c9779a399388a8cb9965b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8c8e439a1dbe04b11d3975c8de93c3ad580d0d96d7c9779a399388a8cb9965b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My own ambition, if ever I took to keeping a shop, would be merely to be in a congenial line of business.",
      "output_sha256": "8e8a5dd7ba9e7e069f5e690c5ef665c82b6d76967855379867d1e83c8c3a7a15",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e8a5dd7ba9e7e069f5e690c5ef665c82b6d76967855379867d1e83c8c3a7a15",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Some things are interesting to sell, and some most emphatically are not.",
      "output_sha256": "0c9e425f5c2aadf2723cfe108b6c38c70207b8289bece5545aa78e11245aa1d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c9e425f5c2aadf2723cfe108b6c38c70207b8289bece5545aa78e11245aa1d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For instance, selling old books would seem ideal, yet I find that I would much prefer to keep them for myself.",
      "output_sha256": "2d13aae8abc0499d4aced5e5f240bda7ac4581a480f1d6503304e7fbdf070145",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.368367,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8457990a54503fb8755e86dda4431bde363c696648a62a6175ffeae89f176b33"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d13aae8abc0499d4aced5e5f240bda7ac4581a480f1d6503304e7fbdf070145",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The same goes for artwork—how could I bear to part with a beautiful piece?",
      "output_sha256": "108b6eedceba80932c0a3a0fe45d88211ada8142ae2612d4f8b53d8147a7f97a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.382564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "adea1a4a2258c65313d92728e69f44d24c137a4972298ed180f879a00919adf9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "108b6eedceba80932c0a3a0fe45d88211ada8142ae2612d4f8b53d8147a7f97a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And, equally, how permit a customer to be so misguided as to pay money for a bad one?",
      "output_sha256": "dfa7c93842f8a862f96352962ad702db1a004c241c07ff0e0f4033dc3bb9cbca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfa7c93842f8a862f96352962ad702db1a004c241c07ff0e0f4033dc3bb9cbca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A fruit shop might offer a pleasant environment, yet I firmly believe that fruit should be distributed freely rather than sold for profit.",
      "output_sha256": "9fe01cd1a8b9249f31ad829a5e031fb493ffafe592a6fe3518d78e2068a682b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.270222,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "005ec81712d6e0d3c1b077d64856c4cee26399bd00840bbc7794675e10dcc933"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9fe01cd1a8b9249f31ad829a5e031fb493ffafe592a6fe3518d78e2068a682b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The tobacconist's was once an urbane and agreeable career; but it is so no longer.",
      "output_sha256": "4f0c61446aafaf43d6d5e7d095057355db38a4d73e5f359d529554ebfa9405c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f0c61446aafaf43d6d5e7d095057355db38a4d73e5f359d529554ebfa9405c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Today, the tobacconist is merely a cog in a colossal Trust, far removed from the intimate atmosphere of the past, where aficionados of tobacco could gather, discuss, and savor their craft—so different from the modern chemist’s shop, filled with seasonal gifts and photographs.",
      "output_sha256": "eed2dd4cd0ff8b6956e718f59ee398d48237581dcbc0636e2db6cd29167bdfe2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.358643,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d4887dcae83f17664363f3cda6ca320ae11fa66ad03daffde09e97848f9ed447"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eed2dd4cd0ff8b6956e718f59ee398d48237581dcbc0636e2db6cd29167bdfe2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That ingenious and adventurous tobacconist, Mr. Godall, revisiting the London which he found, or made, so like Baghdad, would have to discover a new kind of headquarters.",
      "output_sha256": "a0b21e4a8e4204defd135b390700217d82d2baaca437c17053bb88c82f82133b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0b21e4a8e4204defd135b390700217d82d2baaca437c17053bb88c82f82133b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps he would open an oyster-bar (it was in an oyster-bar near Leicester Square that the young man proffered the cream tarts); more likely an American bar.",
      "output_sha256": "57c7837f4a8d9678c4018d8e3abefc64505a77937916a229dc156c115c46b04f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "57c7837f4a8d9678c4018d8e3abefc64505a77937916a229dc156c115c46b04f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, if his true aim were to observe human nature at its most raw and impulsive—particularly at night—he might consider running a coffee stall.",
      "output_sha256": "d0e1d166d097a67819de712826cc2add94b5a06edb3d689f7b0480aebfd0e065",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.518434,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3828491dc893554f1357edd706ff7e6618f2eca077222f2d046f4dc0610b985c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d0e1d166d097a67819de712826cc2add94b5a06edb3d689f7b0480aebfd0e065",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After ten o'clock, the coffee-stall men are the truest friends that poor humanity has.",
      "output_sha256": "09894b932670e4f2e38bf95ff576618aed94abf2eddb14b165bd9c8146fdf2a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "09894b932670e4f2e38bf95ff576618aed94abf2eddb14b165bd9c8146fdf2a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There’s a coffee stall just a stone’s throw from my home, and no matter the hour I return, its owner is always lively and cheerful, serving the hottest beverages to restless patrons.",
      "output_sha256": "0a484de30f8c132e9ca4e500ce298f77c841796872231e0a10da2dc1472cfd9b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.480556,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d32c3e28c9ff43bd0c8d315531dad7c4a291f67fe7065c344cff088a8bc152b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0a484de30f8c132e9ca4e500ce298f77c841796872231e0a10da2dc1472cfd9b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His stall is surrounded by hungry and thirsty revellers, chiefly soldiers, not infrequently accompanied by the fair.",
      "output_sha256": "efa7aacc77b34c33403aac9a944ec763c64135dbc7c68ff5e77b2300949728b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "efa7aacc77b34c33403aac9a944ec763c64135dbc7c68ff5e77b2300949728b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Everyone greets him by name, and the atmosphere is filled with laughter and conversation.",
      "output_sha256": "225de5359017215f4f1b7537c213286cee355cef3f11776678cd3d4ca576f61f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.384696,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d01c5f1ace7a73504fd4b30db5f3bada28aea554d16edda04b230f3fa414d225"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "225de5359017215f4f1b7537c213286cee355cef3f11776678cd3d4ca576f61f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And no matter at what hour in the night I wake, or from what disconcerting dream, I am always at once secure in my mind that the old recognisable world is still about me and I have not passed over in my sleep, because the voices and laughter about the coffee-stall fill the air.",
      "output_sha256": "2b8694ca6c96b3e077faf7e482b8e4a9fc16dc7e83c09530b7c6e19d7d25d635",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "2b8694ca6c96b3e077faf7e482b8e4a9fc16dc7e83c09530b7c6e19d7d25d635",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Good,\" I say, \"I am still here.\"",
      "output_sha256": "7a1d8654ff26c14e7b2442df7461d2b6af94e4c99c650e21da2c9ae3f2f2c962",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a1d8654ff26c14e7b2442df7461d2b6af94e4c99c650e21da2c9ae3f2f2c962",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now it would be a pleasant thing, and prove one's life not to have been lived in vain, to be able to minister in the small hours gaily to so many heroes, and incidentally to impart to wakeful and disquieted neighbours reassurance of stability.",
      "output_sha256": "bfe18c521bce0b7da5d6d13354f3850220d0529efb52f7fed569e82b9bba4ae5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "bfe18c521bce0b7da5d6d13354f3850220d0529efb52f7fed569e82b9bba4ae5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
